karr #9 (a68b753) made list() in WWW::Forgejo::API::Repo::Issues and WWW::Forgejo::API::Repo::PullRequests forward %params into the query string (list(state => 'open')), and it is tested (t/30-issues-prs.t: 'list forwards filter params to the query string'). But the =method list POD block in both modules still only shows $self->list with no arguments and says just 'List all issues.' / 'List all pull requests.' - no mention that filter params are accepted and forwarded. Non-blocking, but worth a one-line POD update for www-forgejo-worker before or shortly after release. Found during www-forgejo-release-checker audit of main (commit 3e4e592).
